msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Ankieta po kursie {#post-course-survey}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Congratulations on completing the \"General formulation of quantum "
"information\" course by IBM&reg;! Please take a moment to help us improve "
"our course by filling out the following [quick "
"survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9WuCWHSXP8rXo7Y). Your "
"feedback will be used to enhance our content offering and user experience. "
"Thank you!\n"
msgstr ""
"> **Note:** This survey is provided by IBM Quantum and relates to the "
"original English content. To give feedback on doQumentation's website, "
"translations, or code execution, please [open a GitHub "
"issue](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/issues).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Sprawdź swoją wiedzę {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button"
" below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for "
"General formulation of quantum information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Po ukończeniu lektury i zadań w tym kursie kliknij poniższy przycisk, aby "
"przejść do platformy IBM Training, gdzie możesz przystąpić do egzaminu "
"odznakowego dla General formulation of quantum information.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly"
" to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be "
"sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr ""
"Egzamin składa się z 20 pytań, a do zaliczenia wymagane jest udzielenie co "
"najmniej 16 poprawnych odpowiedzi. Po uzyskaniu wyniku zaliczającego odznaka"
" zostanie automatycznie wysłana na adres e-mail użyty do rejestracji w IBM "
"Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing "
"score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr ""
"Upewnij się, że jesteś gotowy/gotowa do przystąpienia do egzaminu. Jeśli nie"
" uzyskasz wyniku zaliczającego w dwóch próbach, egzamin zostanie tymczasowo "
"zablokowany.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable "
"in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Uwaga: Te egzaminy na platformie IBM Training mogą być tymczasowo "
"niedostępne w ciągu najbliższych kilku dni ze względu na prace "
"konserwacyjne.\n"

